  "description": "<p>This high-quality area rug features a unique Bigfoot design, bringing a touch of outdoor adventure and personality to any home. With its detailed Sasquatch imagery, this rug is perfect for enthusiasts of nature and wildlife, adding rustic charm to various indoor settings.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a detailed Bigfoot and Sasquatch design.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft surface for a cozy feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Includes a non-slip backing for safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for nature lovers and those who appreciate wildlife.</li>\n<li>Designed for low maintenance and easy cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This area rug is an ideal addition to living rooms, bedrooms, or cabins, enhancing the decor with its rustic and adventurous theme. It provides a unique focal point in spaces where nature and unique design are appreciated.</p>",
